WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:57.380
One day, Deho was struck by a terrible drought.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.720
So strong that Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.550
dried up

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:15.560
The magicians of Deho performed a great ceremony,

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:17.360
to fill the lake with energy

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:26.620
The ritual caused heavy hail

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.670
Among all the hailstones

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.630
there was one that didn't melt

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:49.550
This hailstone first turned into fire,

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:51.520
then the stone

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:53.810
and then into the water

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:58.230
Then she returned to the beginning again - she became ice

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.780
At the same time, black dust was released

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:07.490
This dust was called Reflector and was used in the alchemy of souls

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:14.040
The power of the reflector was truly amazing

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:19.790
You can bring the dead back to life by summoning his soul

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:23.300
We can exchange bodies

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:27.260
You can even expel the soul from the body

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.850
and capture his energy

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:41.020
As a result, this limitless power created chaos

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:54.120
The country turned into a bloody mess because of the magicians,

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:59.790
who started the massacre for the reflector

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo, Zero_Amamiya

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:11.600
The man who stopped this chaos

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:17.310
was Master So Kyung, founder of Sosnovy Bor

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.860
I was his student

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.620
Such an amazing ice stone

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.660
Where is he now? I want to see

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.290
This is a very scary stone

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.080
The magic of this stone

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:42.790
created terrible things that can hurt people

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:46.550
Baby, where did you find this doll?

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:48.510
In the mountains

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.390
Would you trade for this?

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:55.930
Yes

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.150
It's a damn relic

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:17.580
-What was that?
-What was that?

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:20.710
Dangerous item created by magic

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:23.040
I know what it is. Relics

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.460
Jinyeowon is full of them

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:28.380
Yes

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:31.300
There are many much more dangerous objects in Jinyeowon

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.970
There are a lot of unique items there,

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:37.350
created by the power of ice stone

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:48.690
They are waiting for the opportunity to get out into the light again

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.790
Do you want me to take it with you?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.750
I don't want to

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.670
Let me be Won Moo Deok, whom everyone avoids,

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.130
but I don't serve everyone

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.390
How dare she?

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.890
She should have been grateful

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:21.600
This cinnamon and ginger wine has a very strong cinnamon flavor.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:23.940
Thank you Your Highness

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:28.610
Smells like cinnamon

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:33.530
So impudent

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.110
Is something bothering you?

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.910
Apparently I got dirty about Won Moo Deok

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.370
The stench doesn't go away

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.910
Smells good

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.830
Forget it. Go

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:49.840
Go away already

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:51.420
Yes, Your Highness

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:01.850
I was merciful and saved her from trouble.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:04.020
Gave her a sachet and a silk dress

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:14.070
So ungrateful

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:21.740
- I'm grateful
- I told you to leave...

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:29.750
Won Moo Deok?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.290
How did you get here?

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:35.300
I have your sachet

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:40.260
I came because you need something from me again

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.930
I was thinking about me, Your Highness,

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.100
that's why I came

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:46.310
Are you saying you read my mind?

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:50.860
Excellent

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:56.490
Drink some cinnamon and ginger wine. The aroma is stronger than last time

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:07.540
Smells wonderful

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:10.420
Yes?

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:18.470
I must say I love this place

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.680
I hope you will continue to think of me like you did today.

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.140
I will come to you every time

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.240
The palace is a good place

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.700
You wear silk

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.170
drink fragrant wine

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.460
Do you know why I thought about you?

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.130
Because you are Won Moo Deok

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.260
But now you don't smell bad

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:08.680
Your Highness

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:09.640
Who are you?

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.860
You caught me

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.210
The villain got here

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.750
- Search everything
- Yes, Your Highness

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.680
But why in the guise of Moo Deok?

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.060
Look at every corner

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.440
- Yes
- Yes

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:01.240
The Crown Prince is here

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.280
Prince?

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.960
I'm looking for someone

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.790
I was told I would find him here

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:18.460
Did something happen? Look worried

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:22.300
The maid caused problems and disappeared, we are looking for her

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:23.380
Maid?

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:25.220
She doesn't work for us

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.470
Moo Dok. Chan family maid

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.180
That's what I'm looking for

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.720
Did something happen?

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:34.480
This maid...

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.900
accidentally broke the yin-yang jade that was intended

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.820
for wedding rings

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.740
I told you to be careful

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.160
What will you do now?

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:51.080
Sorry, madam

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:52.950
Forgive me

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.290
I'll call its owner here

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.460
Lock her in the annex

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.590
Sorry

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.460
Sorry!

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:05.760
She was probably afraid of punishment

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:09.050
While she was locked up, she stole jade and escaped

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:15.350
Considering that we haven't found her yet,

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:18.270
I think she has already left this place

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:21.730
Got scared and ran away?

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.110
Such a brave girl?

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:28.740
The Mages of Jeonjingak have arrived

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:40.170
Your Highness, what brings you here?

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.840
And you, Yul?

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.420
I'm looking for someone

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:46.970
Are you also looking for Moo Deok?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.510
Yes

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:50.970
I came because of her

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.190
She broke the jade

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:03.570
and then ran away so as not to be punished

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:07.700
Why didn’t you make a ring that day?

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:12.580
I came to Chwisonra to “lend” my hand, but they told me you left

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.450
I decided to make them later

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:20.420
Yul, why are you looking for Moo Deok?

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:24.880
I saw the same vision as you, Your Highness

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:46.320
How did you get here?

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.490
I came because you missed me

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:55.910
What does this mean?

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.580
You missed the one you met in Danhyangok

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.080
Stop fooling me

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.460
Missed you?

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.000
- Nothing like that
- Lie

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:06.920
You whistled

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:13.180
The broken leg didn't bother you

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.850
And you weren't afraid that you'd be scolded

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.890
Because you liked her

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:28.780
Keep thinking about her

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.120
Then I will come to you again

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.080
You...

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:46.960
not a person

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:59.810
Will you get rid of me?

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:03.270
Then we won't see each other again

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:36.390
It wasn't her. Just a vision

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.640
So it was a vision?

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:43.520
It was strange, so I came to Jwisungra to find Moo Deok

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.650
They told me she was brought here

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:49.110
She wasn't dragged. She had an errand

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.530
And she disappeared with an important relic

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.110
We are looking for a thief, not a vision

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:02.910
And here is her owner

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:21.350
Is Master Li absent again today?

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:24.140
This man is like the wind

00:14:24.850 --> 00:14:26.350
He left me the dog and left

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:30.060
Is Gwigu also made from ice stone?

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:33.940
Master So Kyung made it from the energy of the stone,

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.150
to find traces of witchcraft

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.910
Uk broke Gwiga's urn,

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:42.990
that's why Master Li returned his soul from Jinyeowon

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.330
and invested in this dog

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:48.710
You really don't know where Master Seo Kyung is

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.130
sealed the stone?

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:53.960
I don't know

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:57.840
Do you think the alchemy of souls has spread again?

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.090
because someone found the stone?

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.970
The only way to transmigrate a soul without mastering Hwangsu is

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.230
use stone

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:10.560
I'm sure someone printed it out

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:12.770
and returning to the light again

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:16.070
Well that's not good

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:20.280
The horror of 200 years ago must not be allowed to repeat itself.

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.910
We need to find an ice stone

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:37.090
I was ordered to give this to you

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:50.140
I thought you'd lay low for now

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:53.610
Will you help someone else migrate?

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.360
Tell me I received the package

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:01.490
Yes

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.920
Quickly find me a eunuch who will replace him

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:16.840
Your soul will migrate into his body, choose wisely

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.090
Yes

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:21.180
I served Dan Zhu

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.260
not to migrate into the body of a eunuch

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.350
I use Nak Soo

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:29.770
to get the body I want

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:41.200
My maid did a terrible thing

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.700
As her owner, I will bear full responsibility

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:46.160
Sorry

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:53.080
You're probably upset that the jade for the rings was broken.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.630
I begged my mother for this jade,

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.590
because the rings are made from it

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:01.840
will make the marriage long and happy

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.180
But he's broken

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:06.430
I didn't know it had such deep meaning

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.890
I have to say I'm upset too

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:14.480
We will find a more suitable jade for the rings

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.860
I accept your apology

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.650
- You can go
- Thank you

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:23.650
I can't

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:27.200
I have to find Moo Deok

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.410
I want to find this evil maid

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.120
so that she returns the yin-yang jade

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:39.710
She is weak, her legs are short, she could not go far

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:44.340
Please allow me to look for it myself.

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:50.310
I allow

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:52.270
Thank you

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:56.270
Now I wish you would open the door

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:00.150
Door to Jinyeowon,

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:02.990
where are the relics kept?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:26.090
Only a member of the Jin family can open this door.

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:30.140
Now only Cho Young and I are capable of this

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:33.060
She can't be there

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:34.640
I saw a vision

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.020
Maybe you dreamed

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:42.980
Why are you so sure that the vision was created by a relic?

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:44.030
I saw it too

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.780
Vision as Moo Deok

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:53.120
All the relics that visions can create are in Jinyowon

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.500
Let us check

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.920
Okay I'll open the door

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:03.250
This place is full of dangerous relics

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.840
Evil can take hold of you so much that you cannot return

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.640
Mister, it's too dangerous

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.510
I'll go with him

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.270
I'll go too

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.320
Sounds fun

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.440
When will you get another chance to go to Jinyeowon?

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.180
Come in

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.810
You have one hour

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.950
I need to tell the head

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.120
Moo Deok

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.330
Moo Dok!

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.880
So this is Jinyoewon

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:31.760
They say everything here is expensive. No amount of money can buy you

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.220
Can you not make any noise? We're not on a walk

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:36.470
Are you the owner?

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:40.680
Although, this will be the case if you marry Jin Cho Young

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:43.650
Lucky

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:46.400
All these jewels will be yours, Jin Wook

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:50.650
If you're so jealous of me, you can marry her yourself

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:54.990
But even if you become the owner, how will you control all this?

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.330
Low-grade magician

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:58.740
If you're so cool, can you touch something here?

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:02.620
Head Jinyeowon said not to touch anything here.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:05.710
Justification. You're just scared

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:13.050
- That's right
- What is this?

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:14.550
Don't know. What was that?

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:17.430
Are you okay?

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:19.600
There's something strange here

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:22.180
Aren't you scared?

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.770
Scared

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:27.770
It's dark in here, be careful

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.320
Was he really scared?

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:34.860
Yes. When Yul gets scared, he confuses the direction

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:36.160
Yul, not there!

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:38.830
This way

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:41.620
There, yes

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.540
Let's all be careful

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.170
Yul is always so calm,

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:55.340
and so distracted when he gets scared

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:57.010
Something like this

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:04.180
So let's be careful

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:06.690
Be yourself

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:09.610
Let's go together

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:48.480
How did I end up locked here?

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:01.700
I should have restrained myself

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:05.370
There was no need to provoke her

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:08.870
Told you to be careful

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:12.000
Wait here. Your master will come soon

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:15.210
Madam, what will happen to me now?

00:23:15.300 --> 00:23:18.380
What else? You will be punished

00:23:19.180 --> 00:23:21.430
That's not what I'm worried about

00:23:21.510 --> 00:23:24.220
They say that if you break a yin-yang jade,

00:23:24.310 --> 00:23:27.060
you will never be happy in marriage

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:30.940
What should I do now?

00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:33.980
What does it mean?

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:35.400
Don't talk nonsense

00:23:36.530 --> 00:23:38.280
They say if you break this jade,

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:41.410
the person you love will never love you back

00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:44.910
All the gisaengs in Jwiseonru said so

00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:47.500
Is this true?

00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:48.710
Yes

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:53.170
You didn't know, madam?

00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:55.340
This can't be true

00:23:57.710 --> 00:23:59.510
Then what will happen to me?

00:24:03.220 --> 00:24:04.890
Why are you worried?

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:07.350
what if I broke it?

00:24:11.810 --> 00:24:13.770
You were the one who broke it, right?

00:24:14.690 --> 00:24:17.780
They made me carry him to blame him for it

00:24:18.650 --> 00:24:19.610
Am I right?

00:24:20.860 --> 00:24:24.450
Poor thing. I should have said at least something to my mother then.

00:24:25.120 --> 00:24:27.410
If I humiliated her daughter in front of everyone,

00:24:28.200 --> 00:24:30.370
she wouldn't forgive me

00:24:30.960 --> 00:24:32.250
I'm not afraid of you

00:24:32.920 --> 00:24:36.460
but I fear your mother, the head of Jinyeowon

00:24:39.760 --> 00:24:41.260
Are you so afraid of your mother?

00:24:41.840 --> 00:24:44.760
I may be afraid of mom, but I hate you.

00:24:45.890 --> 00:24:46.930
I'll sell you

00:24:47.810 --> 00:24:50.230
Like you said, my mom is very scary

00:24:50.310 --> 00:24:53.690
You will be sold for breaking jade

00:24:54.270 --> 00:24:55.480
Very far away!

00:25:36.400 --> 00:25:38.400
Did she run away?

00:26:09.970 --> 00:26:12.140
Maybe I should try climbing over the wall?

00:26:50.720 --> 00:26:52.760
How was she able to open Jinyoewon's door?

00:27:00.310 --> 00:27:02.980
So this is Jinyeowon

00:27:06.570 --> 00:27:10.120
If you lock her inside, she might die

00:27:36.930 --> 00:27:38.060
Hey

00:27:45.360 --> 00:27:46.820
So it's you

00:27:51.030 --> 00:27:52.530
Long time no see

00:28:20.020 --> 00:28:21.190
You won't be able to get out

00:28:23.190 --> 00:28:24.440
It won't break

00:28:26.270 --> 00:28:27.610
It won't work!

00:28:31.820 --> 00:28:32.990
Shut up

00:28:43.420 --> 00:28:46.920
Did she die because she didn't have magic?

00:28:48.090 --> 00:28:49.970
What if she was just a vision...

00:28:54.050 --> 00:28:55.140
Cho Young

00:28:56.390 --> 00:29:00.310
I hear the sound of your every move

00:29:02.190 --> 00:29:03.310
The sound is like this

00:29:03.810 --> 00:29:06.060
like two jade hitting each other

00:29:20.250 --> 00:29:21.080
Moo Dok!

00:29:29.550 --> 00:29:31.630
The hour has passed, we need to leave

00:29:31.720 --> 00:29:34.010
I'm not going anywhere, I have to find her

00:29:34.090 --> 00:29:37.470
This place is too big, the three of us won't be able to find her.

00:29:37.550 --> 00:29:40.810
You came here to look around anyway, so you can go

00:29:42.680 --> 00:29:44.480
When did the vision of Moo Deok come to you?

00:29:45.520 --> 00:29:47.310
I don't know how she appeared

00:29:47.810 --> 00:29:49.020
But...

00:29:51.740 --> 00:29:54.450
I came because you were missing me

00:29:54.530 --> 00:29:55.610
Exactly

00:29:55.700 --> 00:29:56.870
She told me that too

00:29:57.490 --> 00:29:58.990
That she came because I was thinking about her

00:29:59.080 --> 00:30:02.830
So her vision comes by thinking about her?

00:30:03.580 --> 00:30:04.830
So you haven't seen her

00:30:05.500 --> 00:30:07.080
She came to me and Yulia,

00:30:07.170 --> 00:30:09.750
but not to you, although you are her owner

00:30:09.840 --> 00:30:12.630
Why were you even thinking about Moo Deok?

00:30:16.510 --> 00:30:18.680
I drank cinnamon and ginger wine

00:30:18.760 --> 00:30:21.770
Did you then get her so drunk that she smelled of cinnamon a meter away?

00:30:21.850 --> 00:30:22.810
Yes

00:30:23.810 --> 00:30:25.770
That day I also gave her a sachet

00:30:25.850 --> 00:30:28.690
The smell of cinnamon must have come from him

00:30:29.690 --> 00:30:30.940
Oh, you’re talking about that sachet,

00:30:31.730 --> 00:30:34.400
which she hung near the toilet to ward off flies?

00:30:35.070 --> 00:30:36.490
Near the toilet?

00:30:36.570 --> 00:30:39.870
Thank you, Your Highness. It keeps flies away so well

00:30:41.790 --> 00:30:44.330
Yul, what were you doing when the vision came to you?

00:30:47.250 --> 00:30:48.330
Mirror

00:30:49.630 --> 00:30:52.090
- My mirror broke
- Mine too

00:30:54.920 --> 00:30:56.760
Does it appear from the mirror?

00:30:59.090 --> 00:31:00.260
Mirror?

00:31:05.640 --> 00:31:06.770
Is this it?

00:31:18.030 --> 00:31:20.160
It's not you, it's fake

00:31:20.240 --> 00:31:21.450
Vision

00:31:30.420 --> 00:31:31.840
So it's you

00:31:37.920 --> 00:31:39.720
Is she trapped in the mirror?

00:31:40.680 --> 00:31:41.800
Yes

00:31:41.890 --> 00:31:44.970
We couldn't see what's inside, but we're sure it's there

00:31:45.640 --> 00:31:46.850
She was swallowed up by the mirror of Tosca

00:31:48.020 --> 00:31:49.270
Mirror of Tosca?

00:31:49.350 --> 00:31:51.730
This relic creates visions

00:31:52.360 --> 00:31:53.690
using other mirrors,

00:31:53.770 --> 00:31:56.360
to show what a person wants to see

00:31:57.650 --> 00:32:00.200
She doesn't have magic, so it must have consumed her,

00:32:00.280 --> 00:32:01.660
when she looked at him

00:32:03.370 --> 00:32:05.700
We need to extract Moo Deok from the mirror

00:32:05.790 --> 00:32:09.250
Our spells won't work because the energy inside is too strong

00:32:10.670 --> 00:32:12.460
Please take the Mirror of Longing out of Jinyeowon

00:32:13.500 --> 00:32:14.670
It's impossible

00:32:16.000 --> 00:32:17.960
The relic swallowed a man

00:32:18.050 --> 00:32:20.010
It's too dangerous to take the mirror out of there

00:32:21.470 --> 00:32:23.260
I command you as Crown Prince

00:32:23.350 --> 00:32:24.470
Take the mirror outside

00:32:26.930 --> 00:32:30.730
The united council gave us an amulet to protect Jinyowon

00:32:30.810 --> 00:32:32.940
precisely in such situations

00:32:35.860 --> 00:32:39.150
I can't bear it even by the king's order

00:32:41.990 --> 00:32:43.490
Uk won't work

00:32:44.660 --> 00:32:45.950
without Moo Deok

00:32:46.030 --> 00:32:48.500
Then he'll have to stay inside

00:32:49.330 --> 00:32:51.710
When the hour is up,

00:32:51.790 --> 00:32:53.670
I will seal the door

00:32:56.800 --> 00:32:57.710
Mother

00:32:58.590 --> 00:33:00.590
I found the yin-yang jade

00:33:04.430 --> 00:33:05.970
Moo Deok didn't steal it

00:33:07.010 --> 00:33:08.560
I found him

00:33:08.640 --> 00:33:11.140
so take out the mirror of Tosca and save Moo Deok

00:33:11.230 --> 00:33:13.940
Chan Wook will die if he is locked inside

00:33:14.730 --> 00:33:15.810
Don't interfere

00:33:17.770 --> 00:33:20.860
Once the promised time is up, I will seal the door.

00:33:36.580 --> 00:33:38.090
Don't waste your energy

00:33:38.170 --> 00:33:40.260
You know you can't break it

00:33:40.340 --> 00:33:42.260
Shut up! You're just a vision

00:33:42.340 --> 00:33:44.840
Yes I am a vision

00:33:46.090 --> 00:33:47.930
A vision that shows the real you

00:33:52.520 --> 00:33:55.310
People can't look at themselves from the outside

00:33:55.400 --> 00:33:57.770
Only a mirror can help them with this

00:33:58.940 --> 00:34:01.440
Therefore, your self-image

00:34:02.570 --> 00:34:04.240
also just a vision

00:34:07.950 --> 00:34:10.990
This is how others perceive you too

00:34:11.870 --> 00:34:15.870
They see only what they want and create the image they want.

00:34:18.540 --> 00:34:19.880
This is also all a vision

00:34:20.550 --> 00:34:21.920
If you're telling the truth

00:34:23.090 --> 00:34:25.590
it means people only see visions and nothing else

00:34:26.840 --> 00:34:27.840
Exactly

00:34:28.680 --> 00:34:31.720
I turn into what they want to see most and show it to them

00:34:36.060 --> 00:34:37.730
I'll do the same for you

00:34:45.150 --> 00:34:46.700
Give me your energy

00:34:46.780 --> 00:34:47.820
Then I

00:34:49.030 --> 00:34:51.410
I will turn into the most ideal version of you

00:34:57.040 --> 00:34:58.210
But...

00:34:59.710 --> 00:35:02.710
you need my reflection to create that vision

00:35:03.960 --> 00:35:05.130
What?

00:35:05.720 --> 00:35:07.510
If there is nothing to reflect,

00:35:09.390 --> 00:35:10.930
the mirror will become useless

00:35:31.280 --> 00:35:33.830
You're just a piece of glass

00:35:35.580 --> 00:35:37.160
Enough talk

00:35:38.330 --> 00:35:39.580
Moo Dok!

00:35:40.750 --> 00:35:42.340
Are you there?

00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:45.130
Moo Dok!

00:35:46.710 --> 00:35:47.880
Chan Wook

00:35:50.640 --> 00:35:51.680
Chan Wook!

00:35:53.560 --> 00:35:55.310
Chan Wook, I'm here

00:35:57.520 --> 00:35:58.770
Found

00:36:06.190 --> 00:36:07.820
Time's up

00:36:08.490 --> 00:36:10.660
Cho Young, seal the door

00:36:10.740 --> 00:36:11.820
Mother

00:36:12.820 --> 00:36:15.410
- Now
- Please wait

00:36:27.300 --> 00:36:28.880
I want to login

00:36:30.340 --> 00:36:32.300
If the relic cannot be taken outside,

00:36:32.390 --> 00:36:36.760
then I’ll go in there myself and pull her out of the mirror

00:36:36.850 --> 00:36:39.930
How can I allow a powerful magician to enter?

00:36:40.020 --> 00:36:41.310
Trust me

00:36:42.100 --> 00:36:44.690
I will not touch a single artifact with my finger

00:36:44.770 --> 00:36:46.150
I don't even know

00:36:46.230 --> 00:36:49.530
The magician from Sosnovy Bor has already betrayed my trust

00:36:51.650 --> 00:36:55.070
Have you already let the Pine Forest magician into Jinyeowon?

00:36:57.990 --> 00:36:59.700
If you want to save Chan Wook,

00:36:59.790 --> 00:37:03.540
you will have to ask the magicians of Jeongjingak to get him out of there

00:37:07.710 --> 00:37:08.760
Head,

00:37:08.840 --> 00:37:10.010
we don't have much time

00:37:13.550 --> 00:37:15.930
Yul, I want you to come in

00:37:16.680 --> 00:37:18.260
and brought Uka out of there

00:37:23.810 --> 00:37:24.940
Moo Deok

00:37:26.020 --> 00:37:27.360
While you were away

00:37:28.610 --> 00:37:30.240
I was thinking about

00:37:31.950 --> 00:37:33.240
what can I do,

00:37:34.570 --> 00:37:36.660
to keep you close

00:37:39.950 --> 00:37:41.830
If I become Jeonbugwan's gwangju,

00:37:43.750 --> 00:37:45.420
you can become my deputy

00:37:46.330 --> 00:37:48.000
Why do I need this?

00:37:48.090 --> 00:37:50.760
You said you don't want to remain my maid

00:37:50.840 --> 00:37:53.680
We can't tell anyone that you are my teacher

00:37:53.760 --> 00:37:56.300
But you can stay if you become my assistant

00:37:56.390 --> 00:37:59.510
Will Gwangju Jeonbugwan keep a nomad by his side?

00:38:01.470 --> 00:38:02.680
Are you crazy

00:38:05.900 --> 00:38:08.270
I thought about this when I heard the news about my wedding

00:38:09.270 --> 00:38:11.230
“He finally has an escape route.”

00:38:12.320 --> 00:38:14.070
"How will I live without him?"

00:38:15.820 --> 00:38:17.740
I'm sure you felt lost

00:38:23.710 --> 00:38:25.330
When you're not around, neither am I

00:38:27.670 --> 00:38:28.960
I feel lost

00:38:43.890 --> 00:38:45.060
Moo Deok

00:38:47.150 --> 00:38:48.440
I miss you

00:39:22.430 --> 00:39:24.180
If I get caught, pretend you don't know anything

00:39:25.020 --> 00:39:27.850
No one here will allow this beast to attack me.

00:39:34.190 --> 00:39:35.900
Then help me

00:39:35.990 --> 00:39:37.860
go up there

00:39:38.530 --> 00:39:39.360
Okay

00:39:39.450 --> 00:39:42.910
I'll take you to the top of this tree

00:40:15.780 --> 00:40:16.690
Moo Deok

00:40:17.190 --> 00:40:18.190
What's going on?

00:40:20.490 --> 00:40:21.660
She's here

00:40:21.740 --> 00:40:22.950
Who?

00:40:23.530 --> 00:40:25.490
It's her, the blind girl!

00:40:26.330 --> 00:40:27.700
It's an ice stone!

00:40:32.000 --> 00:40:33.500
The mirror will break into pieces

00:40:34.210 --> 00:40:35.130
Move away

00:41:38.860 --> 00:41:39.900
Mister

00:41:40.400 --> 00:41:41.650
Moo Deok

00:41:41.740 --> 00:41:44.070
-Are you okay?
- Everything is fine

00:41:44.160 --> 00:41:46.070
- Is Mu Deok safe?
- Of course

00:42:15.310 --> 00:42:17.900
I tripped while carrying the yin-yang jade

00:42:19.020 --> 00:42:21.360
I think he broke then

00:42:22.650 --> 00:42:25.490
So you were trying to shift the blame onto the maid for the already broken jade

00:42:27.320 --> 00:42:28.570
And the mirror of Tosca?

00:42:29.780 --> 00:42:31.700
It stood nearby

00:42:31.790 --> 00:42:33.500
but I didn't even touch him

00:42:34.120 --> 00:42:37.170
Uk is not strong enough to break it

00:42:38.080 --> 00:42:39.540
Then it must be

00:42:39.630 --> 00:42:42.800
I damaged the mirror when I fell

00:42:46.930 --> 00:42:48.260
Ah Moo Deok

00:42:49.050 --> 00:42:51.970
Did you also lock yourself in Jinyowon?

00:42:52.060 --> 00:42:55.690
I sealed the door, but she walked in on her own.

00:42:55.770 --> 00:42:59.520
Only members of the Jin family can open the doors of Jinyeowon.

00:43:01.190 --> 00:43:02.690
You say Moo Deok was able to open them?

00:43:04.780 --> 00:43:06.200
Then perhaps

00:43:07.150 --> 00:43:08.780
I was the one who opened them

00:43:09.570 --> 00:43:12.450
I just saw her going in there and closed the door in anger.

00:43:15.120 --> 00:43:16.160
Sorry

00:43:17.710 --> 00:43:19.080
I'll say

00:43:20.670 --> 00:43:23.590
so that no one talks about what happened

00:43:26.130 --> 00:43:29.140
I won't say anything either
so as not to spoil your reputation

00:43:30.390 --> 00:43:32.140
I offer my sincere apologies

00:43:36.060 --> 00:43:37.310
Are you okay?

00:43:38.060 --> 00:43:39.400
Still don't see anything?

00:43:41.230 --> 00:43:42.150
No

00:43:42.730 --> 00:43:44.980
When the mirror broke, the light was very bright

00:43:45.610 --> 00:43:47.150
I can't open my eyes

00:43:50.450 --> 00:43:52.370
I need to cover your eyes

00:43:56.000 --> 00:43:57.120
Here

00:44:01.540 --> 00:44:05.340
If you look at the sun for too long, you can lose your vision for a while

00:44:06.090 --> 00:44:07.300
You'll get better soon

00:44:09.050 --> 00:44:10.550
Forgive me

00:44:11.140 --> 00:44:12.600
It's not your fault

00:44:13.390 --> 00:44:14.970
It's all Ms. Jin's fault

00:44:25.650 --> 00:44:27.490
Moo Deok, are you okay?

00:44:28.320 --> 00:44:30.780
What are you doing here, Mr. Dan Gu?

00:44:32.570 --> 00:44:33.990
I was worried

00:44:34.620 --> 00:44:35.990
Damaged my eyes

00:44:36.580 --> 00:44:38.200
Mr. Yul, have you come too?

00:44:42.710 --> 00:44:45.840
Let them examine you in Sejukwon, I'll take you there

00:44:45.920 --> 00:44:47.840
The palace is not far, she can go there

00:44:48.340 --> 00:44:50.590
Your Highness, are you here too?

00:44:56.100 --> 00:44:57.850
I will provide you with the king's doctors

00:44:58.470 --> 00:44:59.850
Nothing is needed

00:44:59.930 --> 00:45:03.190
She is blinded by the light, her eyes are not damaged

00:45:04.230 --> 00:45:07.360
I know it's not your fault
but they came here because of you

00:45:07.440 --> 00:45:10.150
So apologize and thank everyone

00:45:13.200 --> 00:45:14.660
Sorry to disturb you

00:45:15.320 --> 00:45:16.830
Thank you very much

00:45:29.300 --> 00:45:30.420
Master...

00:45:32.010 --> 00:45:33.050
Let's go home

00:45:57.240 --> 00:45:59.200
After what happened

00:46:00.410 --> 00:46:03.210
I don't know what will happen to the wedding

00:46:03.290 --> 00:46:04.670
Did you hear what she said?

00:46:05.500 --> 00:46:08.500
She was ready to seal the door, despite the fact that the master was inside

00:46:09.130 --> 00:46:10.250
What a horror

00:46:10.340 --> 00:46:13.340
It worries him that he will have such a mother-in-law

00:46:13.420 --> 00:46:15.510
She did this to protect Jinyeowon.

00:46:16.260 --> 00:46:18.260
When you have something to protect

00:46:18.350 --> 00:46:21.470
sometimes you have to make tough decisions

00:46:22.140 --> 00:46:23.310
So...

00:46:24.310 --> 00:46:25.940
Would you do the same?

00:46:27.350 --> 00:46:30.230
I dare say that you and I are close

00:46:30.320 --> 00:46:33.740
If I were inside? Would you seal the door?

00:46:34.610 --> 00:46:35.530
So ruthless?

00:46:40.160 --> 00:46:41.290
Really...

00:46:42.160 --> 00:46:43.370
Seems like you would do it

00:46:44.750 --> 00:46:46.870
Even if my life was on the line?

00:46:46.960 --> 00:46:49.420
Don't put me in a difficult position

00:46:50.630 --> 00:46:52.250
due to a fictitious event

00:46:52.340 --> 00:46:54.170
I'm not really locked

00:46:54.920 --> 00:46:57.300
It's hard to lie and say

00:46:57.380 --> 00:46:59.600
- that you would never seal the door?
- I can't

00:47:00.100 --> 00:47:03.640
lie to you

00:47:05.600 --> 00:47:06.770
Exactly

00:47:07.810 --> 00:47:09.860
That's what you should do

00:47:14.360 --> 00:47:16.450
You should say hello to Mr.

00:47:17.110 --> 00:47:20.910
It's not worth it, I have nothing to say to him

00:47:22.120 --> 00:47:24.290
I can't act like everything is fine

00:47:25.080 --> 00:47:28.170
I see. Thanks for everything

00:47:28.750 --> 00:47:29.580
It's time for you

00:47:39.090 --> 00:47:40.340
But still, maid Kim,

00:47:42.720 --> 00:47:44.310
if I had to seal the door,

00:47:45.810 --> 00:47:47.430
it would break my heart

00:47:50.150 --> 00:47:51.520
to pieces

00:47:59.150 --> 00:48:01.950
Unyielding and slow-witted

00:48:04.160 --> 00:48:06.790
"How can I seal the door if you're inside?"

00:48:08.250 --> 00:48:10.370
Couldn't you just say this?

00:48:25.680 --> 00:48:26.930
It was dangerous

00:48:28.680 --> 00:48:30.440
Enter Jinyeowon

00:48:30.520 --> 00:48:33.110
was a thoughtless childish act

00:48:33.190 --> 00:48:34.770
Don't be so angry

00:48:36.360 --> 00:48:38.360
You might think I'm pathetic

00:48:39.450 --> 00:48:40.570
but that's just your vision

00:48:42.620 --> 00:48:43.450
What?

00:48:43.530 --> 00:48:45.700
The mirror in Jinyowon told me

00:48:46.290 --> 00:48:48.160
that people only see

00:48:48.250 --> 00:48:50.500
what do they want

00:48:51.460 --> 00:48:52.500
This is a vision

00:48:52.580 --> 00:48:54.750
Are you saying that you are like a vision to me?

00:48:54.840 --> 00:48:55.920
If that's not the case,

00:48:57.130 --> 00:48:59.170
why do you want me to sit idle?

00:49:02.550 --> 00:49:04.260
All my life I've been desperately trying

00:49:05.260 --> 00:49:07.640
prove to everyone that I am my father's son

00:49:07.720 --> 00:49:08.680
But

00:49:09.980 --> 00:49:11.230
you said it's not true

00:49:11.310 --> 00:49:13.270
It hurt me, but it helped me get rid of illusions

00:49:13.980 --> 00:49:15.480
But even after everything,

00:49:15.560 --> 00:49:17.730
why do you want me to remain a vision?

00:49:17.820 --> 00:49:19.320
I don't care who you are

00:49:20.650 --> 00:49:22.320
I only want one thing

00:49:23.410 --> 00:49:24.780
Keep you safe...

00:49:26.280 --> 00:49:27.830
from dangers

00:49:32.160 --> 00:49:35.630
My goal has now lost all meaning

00:49:37.920 --> 00:49:39.340
So from now on...

00:49:40.840 --> 00:49:42.340
I will try

00:49:43.800 --> 00:49:45.180
find out who I am

00:49:46.720 --> 00:49:48.220
and who should become

00:50:19.590 --> 00:50:20.880
Do you see now?

00:50:21.760 --> 00:50:23.760
Yes. I see

00:50:28.600 --> 00:50:29.510
What?

00:50:29.600 --> 00:50:31.890
I was told that that mirror plays with the imagination

00:50:31.970 --> 00:50:34.810
I had to check if I really saved you

00:50:36.190 --> 00:50:38.610
You didn't save me. I broke it and got out myself

00:50:39.480 --> 00:50:40.320
What?

00:50:40.400 --> 00:50:42.150
When I'm stuck in the mirror

00:50:42.820 --> 00:50:45.070
for a moment my strength returned,

00:50:45.150 --> 00:50:46.910
like that time in Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:50:47.910 --> 00:50:50.200
I'm sure I broke the mirror using my own strength.

00:50:50.280 --> 00:50:51.870
How's that?

00:50:51.950 --> 00:50:54.040
I was so happy, I thought I saved you

00:50:54.120 --> 00:50:55.210
I rolled my lip

00:50:55.290 --> 00:50:57.920
You should be grateful that you weren't sucked into it.

00:50:58.000 --> 00:51:01.000
You were inside, I was thinking about it

00:51:01.090 --> 00:51:02.630
What nonsense

00:51:03.130 --> 00:51:05.050
It wouldn't trade you for me

00:51:05.130 --> 00:51:07.470
What if it sucked me in? So it's not such a lie?

00:51:07.550 --> 00:51:08.930
Well then I would have survived

00:51:09.010 --> 00:51:10.350
And I would have died!

00:51:12.100 --> 00:51:15.100
Listen, student. When the situation is hopeless,

00:51:15.180 --> 00:51:18.400
the best solution is to sacrifice yourself and save me

00:51:18.480 --> 00:51:19.810
Yeah, right now!

00:51:21.270 --> 00:51:22.650
If I die, then you should too

00:51:22.730 --> 00:51:24.400
You can't live comfortably without me

00:51:26.070 --> 00:51:27.740
And nothing else!

00:51:27.820 --> 00:51:31.030
If you put a student’s life in danger, then you must risk your own life.

00:51:31.950 --> 00:51:34.040
Okay. I'll keep this in mind for the future

00:51:34.910 --> 00:51:36.830
What are you going to do about marrying a woman?

00:51:36.910 --> 00:51:39.630
who almost killed your teacher?

00:51:40.670 --> 00:51:44.130
Marrying her is a guarantee of my safety

00:51:46.800 --> 00:51:48.760
But you almost lost your life

00:51:49.380 --> 00:51:51.180
so I have to risk mine too

00:51:57.640 --> 00:51:59.560
It's a marriage of convenience

00:52:00.190 --> 00:52:03.230
We will resolve all misunderstandings after the wedding

00:52:03.320 --> 00:52:05.860
You are considering me as a son-in-law,

00:52:06.650 --> 00:52:08.280
because I am the heir of the Chan family

00:52:08.360 --> 00:52:10.360
and possible candidate for the post of Gwangju Jeonbugwan

00:52:11.240 --> 00:52:13.370
Our families will unite and become more powerful

00:52:14.330 --> 00:52:17.370
Since this is a marriage of convenience,

00:52:18.160 --> 00:52:20.620
we should talk openly about our strengths and weaknesses

00:52:21.420 --> 00:52:23.920
I'm probably not Gwangju Chang Gang's son

00:52:26.800 --> 00:52:28.800
Such rumors don't bother me

00:52:31.260 --> 00:52:33.100
But what if these rumors...

00:52:34.300 --> 00:52:35.350
really?

00:52:38.270 --> 00:52:40.190
Are you ready to take the risk...

00:52:40.940 --> 00:52:43.810
and accept me as your son-in-law?

00:52:56.030 --> 00:52:58.540
I see you're still wearing the bracelet

00:53:01.460 --> 00:53:02.580
Yes

00:53:05.540 --> 00:53:07.670
Just as arrogant as ever

00:53:16.890 --> 00:53:20.730
Why did you decide to marry Cho Young without discussing it with me?

00:53:21.850 --> 00:53:25.230
Who are you to interfere in our family's affairs?

00:53:25.310 --> 00:53:26.440
Sister,

00:53:28.360 --> 00:53:30.070
I am also a member of the Jin family

00:53:31.820 --> 00:53:36.450
The surname Jin is given only to those whose mothers were from the Jin clan

00:53:37.700 --> 00:53:41.410
My mother was stupid, giving a last name to the one

00:53:42.080 --> 00:53:44.250
whom our father conceived out of wedlock

00:53:44.960 --> 00:53:47.880
You will get rid of me as soon as you become the head of Jinyeowon.

00:53:49.130 --> 00:53:51.510
Still mad at me?

00:53:51.590 --> 00:53:52.720
It's not a matter of offense

00:53:53.840 --> 00:53:55.390
I despise you

00:53:58.350 --> 00:54:01.060
You are a traitor, that's why I despise you

00:54:04.940 --> 00:54:08.110
The head of Jinyeowon should not make decisions based on personal preferences.

00:54:09.400 --> 00:54:11.900
You're making a mistake in choosing Chan Wook

00:54:11.990 --> 00:54:13.400
Don't marry Cho Young to Wook

00:54:13.490 --> 00:54:14.700
What?

00:54:15.410 --> 00:54:19.240
I know the best match for her

00:54:19.990 --> 00:54:21.370
How do you like the Crown Prince...

00:54:22.200 --> 00:54:23.830
as a son-in-law?

00:54:27.790 --> 00:54:31.090
Do you want the Crown Prince to join our family and we live together?

00:54:31.840 --> 00:54:33.510
Cho Young is the second daughter of the family

00:54:33.590 --> 00:54:36.130
Boo Young is the eldest and will lead the family.

00:54:37.010 --> 00:54:39.220
Her future husband will join the family,

00:54:39.300 --> 00:54:40.890
so Cho Young can live with the prince in the palace

00:54:42.430 --> 00:54:46.600
What are you up to? How dare you talk about Boo Young

00:54:51.360 --> 00:54:54.900
I know your husband is still looking for Boo Young

00:54:55.530 --> 00:54:58.200
As Gwangju Jeonbugwan's deputy,

00:54:58.280 --> 00:55:01.080
I will do everything I can to help you find your daughter,

00:55:01.830 --> 00:55:03.160
which you are so desperately looking for

00:55:05.000 --> 00:55:08.920
I will make Boo Young the head of Jinyoung and Jo Young will be the queen.

00:55:09.000 --> 00:55:10.000
So please

00:55:10.090 --> 00:55:11.920
don't marry her to Uka

00:55:14.460 --> 00:55:15.720
Like your brother

00:55:16.470 --> 00:55:19.930
By becoming Gwangju Jeonbugwan, I will support Jinyeowon

00:55:21.390 --> 00:55:23.470
After all, I am a member of the Jin family

00:55:38.700 --> 00:55:41.660
Listen, Yul, that’s what’s strange

00:55:42.370 --> 00:55:44.370
Why were you thinking about Moo Deok?

00:55:45.700 --> 00:55:47.410
I didn't think about her

00:55:48.580 --> 00:55:51.420
I also don’t understand why the mirror showed Mu Deok...

00:55:52.170 --> 00:55:54.210
- And those words of hers...
- What did she say?

00:55:54.960 --> 00:55:56.130
Hey Yul

00:55:56.210 --> 00:55:57.590
We're actually heading that way

00:55:58.220 --> 00:56:00.970
What are you thinking about there? What scares you?

00:56:05.640 --> 00:56:07.020
Everything is fine

00:56:09.850 --> 00:56:11.270
Holy spirits

00:56:14.520 --> 00:56:15.900
Cart with parcels

00:56:16.650 --> 00:56:20.910
Apparently, Cho Young's wedding gifts will be delivered to Sosnovy Bor today

00:56:21.700 --> 00:56:23.580
No one can see them

00:56:24.660 --> 00:56:26.120
We need to help her

00:56:39.090 --> 00:56:41.550
Bird! Catch the bird!

00:56:41.640 --> 00:56:42.930
- What is this?
- Catch her!

00:56:43.600 --> 00:56:44.970
- What is it!
-Where did she fly off to?

00:56:45.640 --> 00:56:48.180
- Over there!
- She's there!

00:56:49.270 --> 00:56:50.810
- How so?
- Well...

00:56:51.770 --> 00:56:53.940
- Hey
- Over there

00:57:28.100 --> 00:57:29.980
Nak Su masters the alchemy of souls

00:57:33.270 --> 00:57:36.150
If her soul left her body, she might still be alive

00:57:43.990 --> 00:57:46.120
You missed the one you met in Danhyangok

00:57:47.870 --> 00:57:49.700
Keep thinking about her

00:57:51.460 --> 00:57:52.790
Then I will come to you again

00:57:54.370 --> 00:57:58.170
Winters in Danhyangok are warmer than you think

00:57:59.170 --> 00:58:02.470
Where the sun shines, the snow melts quickly

00:58:09.600 --> 00:58:10.890
So, Moo Deok...

00:58:12.180 --> 00:58:13.520
this is Nak Soo

00:59:15.870 --> 00:59:18.960
It was you who left the spirit amulet in Danhyangok

00:59:24.300 --> 00:59:26.630
So you're alive, Nak Soo

00:59:49.070 --> 00:59:50.160
Moo Deok

00:59:50.740 --> 00:59:52.410
I'm tired of waiting for you

00:59:53.030 --> 00:59:54.620
Maid Kim didn't tell you?

00:59:54.700 --> 00:59:56.250
You were supposed to come by noon

00:59:58.120 --> 01:00:00.960
Let's hurry. We need to get to Danhyangok before sunset

01:00:01.040 --> 01:00:02.380
Instead of Danhyangok,

01:00:04.420 --> 01:00:05.840
let's go somewhere else

01:00:07.010 --> 01:00:08.090
Where?

01:00:09.130 --> 01:00:11.720
In the east there is an empty temple near a bamboo forest

01:00:12.220 --> 01:00:13.430
We can go there

01:00:19.640 --> 01:00:21.980
Bring Chan Wook there

01:00:22.060 --> 01:00:23.610
Then I will spare your life

01:00:29.450 --> 01:00:31.280
I have to hand you over to live

01:00:32.070 --> 01:00:33.280
That's how it should be

01:00:36.080 --> 01:00:37.540
I won't marry

01:00:38.540 --> 01:00:40.540
I gave them a reason to reject my candidacy

01:00:41.500 --> 01:00:42.630
How's that?

01:00:43.380 --> 01:00:44.420
But...

01:00:47.590 --> 01:00:50.300
Maid Kim has already received the yin-yang jade

01:00:50.970 --> 01:00:52.680
So I made something out of it

01:01:00.100 --> 01:01:01.850
- These are bird eggs
- That's right

01:01:02.520 --> 01:01:03.980
Take one. We'll have one each

01:01:07.940 --> 01:01:10.240
We have quite a peculiar relationship

01:01:10.320 --> 01:01:13.030
Young master and maid. Teacher and student

01:01:13.110 --> 01:01:15.830
So I thought they could remind us of

01:01:16.950 --> 01:01:18.500
so that we remain true to each other

01:01:22.210 --> 01:01:23.460
I'll be the first to choose

01:01:23.540 --> 01:01:25.380
I'll take red, you take blue

01:01:29.760 --> 01:01:33.800
Teacher, let's remain devoted to each other

01:01:40.810 --> 01:01:42.810
- Chan Wook
- Yes?

01:01:45.360 --> 01:01:46.980
Here we will say goodbye to you

01:01:51.360 --> 01:01:53.320
I'll go back to where I came from

01:01:55.570 --> 01:01:58.490
- But they abandoned you
- Today I met them again

01:01:59.120 --> 01:02:00.620
They know who I am

01:02:01.450 --> 01:02:03.210
So they asked me to come back to them

01:02:03.290 --> 01:02:06.130
- I thought they wanted to kill you
- As you can see, I'm still alive

01:02:06.750 --> 01:02:09.130
If they wanted to kill, they would have killed long ago

01:02:09.800 --> 01:02:13.840
If I go back I can regain my energy

01:02:21.560 --> 01:02:22.930
I promised to help you...

01:02:23.020 --> 01:02:25.650
And I said I'd push you off a cliff

01:02:26.860 --> 01:02:30.110
I know I trained you too hard

01:02:32.190 --> 01:02:33.360
and you did everything in your power

01:02:34.700 --> 01:02:37.120
- We can continue...
- No

01:02:37.200 --> 01:02:40.240
If we stick together you'll die

01:02:40.990 --> 01:02:42.580
And I'll get caught

01:03:03.890 --> 01:03:08.060
What made the head of Sosnovy Bor come all the way here in secret?

01:03:08.150 --> 01:03:09.610
I wanted to ask

01:03:10.270 --> 01:03:14.320
about a magician in Jeonbugwan named Cho Chun who died 20 years ago

01:03:19.740 --> 01:03:21.530
Nak Soo's father, Cho Chun,

01:03:22.450 --> 01:03:23.620
mastered the alchemy of souls

01:03:25.620 --> 01:03:27.580
When we found him

01:03:28.080 --> 01:03:30.340
he's already gone wild

01:03:30.420 --> 01:03:34.340
and killed his whole family

01:03:41.300 --> 01:03:43.430
Four families had to fit in,

01:03:44.140 --> 01:03:45.770
to stop the bloodshed

01:03:53.110 --> 01:03:55.860
Was Nak Soo's father also a nomad?

01:03:56.530 --> 01:03:58.200
In the eyes of a child

01:03:58.280 --> 01:04:01.780
We're probably her father's killers

01:04:03.990 --> 01:04:07.080
She probably blamed us for his death.

01:04:07.870 --> 01:04:10.460
and that’s why I came to Sosnovy Bor

01:04:12.750 --> 01:04:15.670
What important issue did you want to discuss?

01:04:15.760 --> 01:04:18.550
Remember something about Nak Soo?

01:04:22.760 --> 01:04:25.890
If we meet again I will kill you

01:04:30.980 --> 01:04:32.860
Are you hinting?

01:04:32.940 --> 01:04:36.230
that I took Cho Chun's daughter under my wing and made her a mercenary?

01:04:36.320 --> 01:04:39.610
You burned her body as soon as you found it.

01:04:39.700 --> 01:04:42.700
Not to hide her identity?

01:04:44.660 --> 01:04:48.410
Instead of answering, I'll tell you about what happened 20 years ago.

01:04:52.040 --> 01:04:53.960
Here in Jeonbugwan we record the stars...

01:04:54.040 --> 01:04:56.300
from one in the morning to three, when energy is at its peak

01:04:57.420 --> 01:05:00.930
Gwangju checks entry at noon, signs are kept here

01:05:02.300 --> 01:05:07.270
One day the sign written down that morning disappeared

01:05:09.270 --> 01:05:12.560
Fortunately, we managed to find her

01:05:15.190 --> 01:05:17.860
When was this?

01:05:21.700 --> 01:05:25.580
The day Chang Gang's wife Do Hwa died and Chang Wook was born

01:05:26.740 --> 01:05:28.790
Cho Chun wrote down the stars that day,

01:05:28.870 --> 01:05:32.420
and I was the one who found the missing sign

01:05:46.720 --> 01:05:49.220
I managed to steal the real sign

01:05:49.310 --> 01:05:52.600
In Jeonbugwan, a fake without the King's star

01:05:58.190 --> 01:05:59.780
Do you want to say

01:06:00.460 --> 01:06:01.900
what do you know

01:06:03.030 --> 01:06:04.990
about what happened when...

01:06:06.870 --> 01:06:08.240
Was Chan Wook born?

01:06:11.830 --> 01:06:15.170
A star ready to change the world has appeared in the sky

01:06:20.340 --> 01:06:23.010
Did you know about the King's star?

01:06:23.090 --> 01:06:25.970
Did you think that the mystery would die with Cho Chun?

01:06:27.550 --> 01:06:30.970
Who do you think turned him into a soul swallower?

01:06:34.020 --> 01:06:36.770
Don't ask questions
to which you don't want to know the answer

01:06:36.850 --> 01:06:40.020
This is the only way you will protect Sosnovy Bor and its inhabitants

01:06:52.830 --> 01:06:56.000
Dan Joo doesn't know you're still alive, Nak Soo

01:06:57.880 --> 01:06:59.380
I didn't tell him

01:07:00.210 --> 01:07:01.670
Bring Chan Wook

01:07:01.750 --> 01:07:03.720
Then I'll keep my mouth shut

01:07:08.260 --> 01:07:10.720
I'm going to move my soul into his body

01:07:30.240 --> 01:07:31.580
Where is Chan Wook?

01:07:32.370 --> 01:07:33.750
He'll come soon

01:07:40.420 --> 01:07:43.000
What brings you here at such a late hour?

01:07:46.470 --> 01:07:47.970
Before Uk was born...

01:07:49.090 --> 01:07:51.350
About 20 years ago...

01:07:51.430 --> 01:07:52.720
Could Chang Gang...

01:07:53.970 --> 01:07:56.060
master a certain type of magic?

01:07:59.400 --> 01:08:00.770
Chang Gan was able...

01:08:02.270 --> 01:08:04.110
resettle the soul?

01:08:19.580 --> 01:08:21.040
Why did it take him so long?

01:08:24.550 --> 01:08:26.010
It's finally starting to rain

01:08:26.960 --> 01:08:28.260
He'll be here now

01:08:32.550 --> 01:08:33.890
Have you fooled me?

01:08:36.220 --> 01:08:38.270
What are you waiting for?

01:08:39.810 --> 01:08:42.900
Since Dan Zhu still hasn't shown up,

01:08:42.980 --> 01:08:45.570
that means you really didn't tell him anything

01:08:47.280 --> 01:08:48.570
Oh you...

01:09:12.970 --> 01:09:14.300
Here we will say goodbye to you

01:09:16.350 --> 01:09:18.560
But what about the empty temple in the forest?

01:09:20.230 --> 01:09:22.850
Why don't you want to take me with you?

01:09:22.940 --> 01:09:25.020
I was going to get rid of you there so I could save myself.

01:09:26.860 --> 01:09:28.900
Now you know, don't you dare follow me

01:09:29.650 --> 01:09:32.490
Then you shouldn't have told me about that temple

01:09:33.700 --> 01:09:35.740
Let you go alone

01:09:36.530 --> 01:09:38.540
knowing that it is dangerous there?

01:09:41.790 --> 01:09:43.290
I'm worse off than you right now

01:09:43.370 --> 01:09:45.920
I missed my chance at life because of some bird's egg.

01:09:46.000 --> 01:09:48.130
Glad I could remind you of devotion

01:09:48.210 --> 01:09:49.760
I really could have died

01:09:53.680 --> 01:09:55.720
I helped you escape death

01:09:56.970 --> 01:09:59.100
so fight to the death

01:10:00.180 --> 01:10:03.850
You talk like you saved me

01:10:05.350 --> 01:10:08.020
If the cloudy sky blesses us with rain,

01:10:09.690 --> 01:10:11.740
then we can both live

01:10:20.540 --> 01:10:22.290
Luck and truth are on your side, Uk

01:10:22.830 --> 01:10:24.580
There's heavy rain outside

01:10:25.500 --> 01:10:27.710
I think my opponent is not much stronger than me

01:10:28.960 --> 01:10:30.590
He is a magician from Jeonbugwan

01:10:30.670 --> 01:10:32.260
Hello. Do you remember me?

01:12:46.270 --> 01:12:48.680
Here it is. Now is the time to use tansu

01:12:48.770 --> 01:12:52.060
Don't try to divide the drops with an uncontrollable sword,

01:12:52.150 --> 01:12:54.440
hold the sword so that drops fall on it

01:13:52.580 --> 01:13:53.790
No...

01:13:57.500 --> 01:13:58.800
What's the matter?

01:13:58.880 --> 01:13:59.840
Alchemy of Souls

01:14:51.100 --> 01:14:53.430
My soul...

01:14:54.020 --> 01:14:55.520
moving now?

01:15:01.340 --> 01:15:12.220
/////////////////////////////////////

01:15:01.340 --> 01:15:12.220
Thanks for watching with us!

01:15:13.240 --> 01:15:16.190
Alchemy

01:15:13.240 --> 01:15:16.190
Shower

01:15:17.000 --> 01:15:18.420
Chan Wook

01:15:19.750 --> 01:15:23.460
So you switched bodies with my student, Gil Joo

01:15:23.550 --> 01:15:26.090
I think Uk became a victim of transmigration of souls

01:15:26.180 --> 01:15:27.090
What?

01:15:27.180 --> 01:15:29.680
The man who transmigrated my father's soul...

01:15:29.760 --> 01:15:31.890
Is this Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan?

01:15:33.930 --> 01:15:36.440
Is that you? Isn't it you?

01:15:36.520 --> 01:15:39.690
Are you sure the ice stone was destroyed?

01:15:40.310 --> 01:15:42.650
Order all our magicians to find Gil Ju

01:15:42.730 --> 01:15:45.150
It must remain a secret that they are nomads
